          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Method",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "As of and window. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Frozen snapshot, as_of 20 Sep 2026 01:51:01 (NYC local time). Requests created 1 Sep 2024 – 31 Aug 2026; data through 31 Aug 2026.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Dev sample. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The dev profile (the default) is a 1-in-25 sample: requests whose unique key is divisible by 25, over the same 24-month window and the carry-in file. A request is wholly in or out of it. The full profile holds every request.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Benchmark ≠ SLA. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The data carries no official service-level targets. The benchmark is internal: per category, the p75 of resolution hours in the Sep 2023 – Aug 2024 baseline year; not NYC policy. The benchmark hours are an engine-provided input from that baseline year, documented in sla_baseline_summary.csv. They are a city-wide threshold, not a volume.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Censoring. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The resolution statistics are optimistic, P90 most: they exclude requests with no valid close, and the R05 zero-minute and over-1-year rows.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Day precision and zero-minute closes. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "A valid close at exactly 00:00:00 (R06) stays valid but has day precision only; zero-minute closes (R05) are excluded from the resolution statistics.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Staleness (R20), city-wide, full profile, not filtered by borough or slicers. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The backlog counts requests open at most 365 days. The stale share of everything open rose from 4.4% (Sep 2024) to 30.2% (Aug 2026). The carry-in holds requests created Sep 2023 – Aug 2024 with no valid close before 1 Sep 2024; 285,164 older requests with no valid close by then were excluded at extract. 6,319 window requests have an UNKNOWN borough; they are visible to City Operations only.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Not shown in v1. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Copilot, automatic page refresh, and Service features (apps, dashboards, alerts, subscriptions, scheduled refresh).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Authorship. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "AI-built, owner-directed: the Power Query, model, measures, RLS and report were written by AI (Claude) from a specification the owner directed; the numbers are checked against an independent Python twin with the reconcile CLI.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
